From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slothfulchat <patches@slothfulchat.invalid>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 16:56:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] web-app: move Experimental features to their own settings
 section
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Advanced had grown into a grab bag: log, server, multi-device, the
whole experimental block, analytics, autostart. Experimental features
now get their own entry in the settings navigation (using the shipped
but previously unreferenced test-tube icon), and Advanced keeps the
rest. The location-streaming info dialog's pointer is updated to
'Settings / Experimental features'.

web-app: group experimental settings by where they show up

Sub-headings in the Experimental section: Composer (emoji completion,
link previews), Chats (read-time badge, location streaming), System
(screen security, background sync, webxdc store URL) — related toggles
now sit together instead of historical order.
